title: Cambium Carbon
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki
url: https://cambiumcarbon.com/our-story/

Founded in 2019. They take trees that have come down in cities and turn them into lumber, where they would otherwise be chipped or landfilled.

They call the sources the four Ds: disease, decay, disaster, and development.

By their own figures a board foot of their Carbon Smart Wood stores 5.23 lbs of CO2e, where ordinary hardwood emits 12.

They also run job training, replant trees, and care for them.

The wood in the [[Oka Chair]] comes from them, out of Baltimore and the woods around it. Justin says he can drive down the street and see where they get it.
